# ultrawidelock_anchor tier: the sealed-link wire codec alone
# (CONFIG_ULTRAWIDELOCK_ANCHOR_MSG, and implied by CONFIG_ULTRAWIDELOCK_WITNESS_CODEC).
# ONE file carries BOTH message families -- WV2 witness reports and WV3 anchor
# reports share a version byte -- so it cannot be split per family. A satellite
# takes this role and nothing else: it encodes its own distance and has no
# geometry, no second distance and no verdict to fuse. Consumers:
# modules/ultrawidelock_anchor/CMakeLists.txt, tests/host/sources.sh.
# Sorted; add HERE and nowhere else.
modules/ultrawidelock_anchor/src/ultrawidelock_witness_msg.c
